5. Flowchart

Flowchart represented as a linear decision/process diagram for clear rendering in Word.
Start → Enter the journey distance → Enter the number of vehicles → Enter each vehicle's mileage and fuel tank capacity → Enter the fuel price → Enter the required fuel reserve → Calculate the fuel required for each vehicle → Check whether each vehicle can complete the journey with the required reserve → If not feasible, exclude that vehicle → If feasible, calculate the total fuel cost → Compare the costs of all feasible vehicles → Identify the lowest-cost feasible vehicle → Display the vehicle details and estimated journey cost → Stop.

